WEBVTT

01:30.730 --> 01:34.910
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.259 --> 01:37.830
[Episode 27]

01:38.229 --> 01:39.890
All these layers of yours here

01:40.229 --> 01:41.789
have names.

01:43.070 --> 01:44.710
One layer is called

01:45.229 --> 01:47.310
saying one thing but meaning another.

01:47.310 --> 01:48.640
Another layer is called

01:48.789 --> 01:50.670
insincerity.

01:50.789 --> 01:51.990
And another is called

01:52.150 --> 01:52.789
being

01:53.200 --> 01:53.759
too

01:53.920 --> 01:54.479
proud

01:54.840 --> 01:55.770
to admit things.

01:58.150 --> 01:59.370
You've said so much,

01:59.920 --> 02:01.310
as if you know me well.

02:07.120 --> 02:08.630
You old demon...

02:09.479 --> 02:10.729
You're just

02:10.960 --> 02:12.520
cold on the outside but warm inside.

02:12.520 --> 02:15.920
You should enjoy
the genuine love of this world—

02:16.560 --> 02:17.430
with laughter

02:17.960 --> 02:18.940
and tears,

02:19.030 --> 02:21.030
so that your demon life be complete.

02:23.750 --> 02:24.710
Are you truly

02:26.660 --> 02:28.110
a human princess?

02:40.360 --> 02:41.000
I...

02:42.160 --> 02:44.000
am me.

02:47.050 --> 02:49.079
But now I'm also not me right now.

02:51.760 --> 02:53.190
In the past,

02:53.360 --> 02:54.120
when reading,

02:54.120 --> 02:57.079
I'd just read
whatever page the book opened to.

02:57.190 --> 02:58.320
When walking,

02:58.400 --> 02:59.680
I'd just follow

02:59.680 --> 03:00.940
wherever the path led.

03:01.150 --> 03:02.480
But now it's different.

03:04.280 --> 03:06.450
I have people I want to protect.

03:07.150 --> 03:09.690
I have things I really want to do.

03:18.430 --> 03:19.000
Ning'an.

03:21.640 --> 03:22.170
Ning'an.

03:48.590 --> 03:50.250
What exactly do you want to do?

03:54.880 --> 03:56.360
Receive the verbal decree:

03:56.360 --> 03:58.360
last month, Princess Ning'an

03:58.360 --> 03:59.910
trespassed into the palace several times

03:59.910 --> 04:01.310
and defied the royal will,

04:01.310 --> 04:04.760
setting a bad example
for the ladies of the inner palace.

04:05.080 --> 04:06.400
From today onward,

04:06.400 --> 04:07.630
Princess Ning'an

04:07.630 --> 04:09.910
must diligently study

04:09.910 --> 04:11.360
and practice swordsmanship daily.

04:11.360 --> 04:12.690
This serves as a warning

04:12.750 --> 04:14.150
to all ladies of the inner palace

04:14.150 --> 04:16.709
to observe proper decorum in all actions.

04:16.829 --> 04:18.920
By imperial order.

04:23.160 --> 04:25.750
Thank you, Father.

04:26.190 --> 04:27.720
A teacher's guidance

04:27.720 --> 04:29.180
must not be taken lightly.

04:30.070 --> 04:32.210
I humbly accept

04:32.750 --> 04:34.880
and will reflect upon it day and night.

04:34.920 --> 04:36.720
If I have any shortcomings,

04:36.720 --> 04:38.630
I will promptly correct them.

04:40.950 --> 04:43.050
A tear-essence...

04:43.270 --> 04:45.750
A tear-essence...

04:59.560 --> 05:00.410
Will reading these books

05:00.410 --> 05:01.810
make you a good princess?

05:07.280 --> 05:08.680
Where did this come from?

05:09.640 --> 05:10.840
I passed through a plum forest

05:10.840 --> 05:12.160
and saw that even in bitter cold,

05:12.160 --> 05:13.510
its fragrance still spread everywhere.

05:13.510 --> 05:15.070
I thought it suited you well,

05:15.070 --> 05:16.270
so I picked it for you.

05:17.430 --> 05:18.230
Thank you.

05:20.190 --> 05:20.720
Wait,

05:21.110 --> 05:22.710
I have something for you too.

05:22.860 --> 05:23.860
Look at this book.

05:33.680 --> 05:34.760
Isn't it touching?

05:36.550 --> 05:37.030
Yes.

05:37.480 --> 05:38.340
It's touching.

05:41.870 --> 05:42.680
Look.

05:42.760 --> 05:43.890
Let me read it to you.

05:46.380 --> 05:48.320
The two people meet at the tower,

05:49.000 --> 05:51.200
gazing at each other with tearful eyes.

05:51.270 --> 05:52.400
Before parting,

05:52.630 --> 05:54.040
they made a vow:

05:54.270 --> 05:54.870
in life,

05:55.240 --> 05:56.600
though they could not share a bed,

05:56.600 --> 05:57.240
in death

05:58.000 --> 05:59.800
they would share the same grave.

06:01.270 --> 06:02.360
But Shanbo

06:02.360 --> 06:03.890
fell ill with worry

06:04.200 --> 06:06.170
and soon passed away.

06:07.600 --> 06:08.550
Yingtai,

06:08.750 --> 06:10.670
shocked by the terrible news,

06:11.360 --> 06:13.310
was overwhelmed with grief.

06:13.520 --> 06:15.930
When she went
to pay respects at his grave,

06:16.600 --> 06:17.950
her deep sorrow

06:19.120 --> 06:20.870
touched the heavens.

06:28.550 --> 06:30.310
Aren't you touched?

06:33.040 --> 06:33.680
I am.

06:36.560 --> 06:37.120
Yes.

06:40.390 --> 06:42.850
Wind, rain, thunder and lightning erupted.

06:43.310 --> 06:44.920
The grave split open.

06:44.920 --> 06:49.500
Yingtai gracefully leapt into the grave.

06:58.240 --> 06:59.650
Seriously!

06:59.680 --> 07:00.410
I'm touched.

07:10.430 --> 07:11.390
Don't be sad.

07:12.030 --> 07:13.380
The story's all made up.

07:22.070 --> 07:22.560
One.

07:24.240 --> 07:24.750
Two.

07:27.510 --> 07:28.160
Three.

07:29.310 --> 07:29.920
Four.

07:33.240 --> 07:34.040
Where's five?

07:35.040 --> 07:37.620
You've been practicing this set for days,

07:37.800 --> 07:39.400
yet you show no improvement.

07:41.240 --> 07:42.120
Raise your hands higher.

07:42.120 --> 07:44.380
Keep your lower body steady. Don't move.

07:45.310 --> 07:46.360
I hear Your Highness

07:46.360 --> 07:49.250
wants to leave Yong'an Palace
by your own abilities.

07:49.250 --> 07:51.010
With your current attitude...

07:51.830 --> 07:52.890
Watch your stance.

07:53.430 --> 07:55.070
With that attitude of yours,

07:55.270 --> 07:56.670
even after a few more years of practice,

07:56.670 --> 07:58.750
I doubt you'll ever leave Yong'an Palace.

07:58.750 --> 08:00.080
It won't take that long.

08:01.220 --> 08:03.930
[Yong'an Palace]

08:13.150 --> 08:15.920
[Yong'an Palace]

08:21.000 --> 08:21.540
You...

08:24.390 --> 08:24.920
Sir!

08:25.030 --> 08:25.590
Sir!

08:25.660 --> 08:26.300
Are you...

08:26.580 --> 08:27.910
Careful, careful.

08:28.310 --> 08:28.870
Sir, are you...

08:28.870 --> 08:30.740
Sir, are you all right?

08:33.460 --> 08:34.750
I'm fine.

08:37.870 --> 08:39.130
Continue practicing.

08:40.270 --> 08:43.360
-Sir, that was careless of you.
-Take me to the imperial physician.

08:43.020 --> 08:48.140
[Yong'an Palace]

08:44.200 --> 08:45.120
Are you okay?

08:45.150 --> 08:47.660
Karma really caught up with you.

08:53.280 --> 08:54.740
That wasn't intentional.

09:19.270 --> 09:20.000
Are you okay?

09:29.790 --> 09:31.480
Why did you catch the sword
with your hand?

09:31.480 --> 09:33.160
Your book says

09:33.440 --> 09:34.960
human men and women
should avoid physical contact.

09:34.960 --> 09:36.630
That doesn't mean you catch a sword
with your bare hand.

09:36.630 --> 09:37.790
You'll get hurt!

09:38.000 --> 09:38.670
It's fine.

09:39.000 --> 09:40.390
If you fell, you would feel pain,

09:40.390 --> 09:41.720
but I have power protecting me,

09:41.720 --> 09:43.030
such a small injury
isn't worth worrying about.

09:43.030 --> 09:44.430
So what if you have power?

09:44.510 --> 09:47.510
Not worrying about it doesn't mean
you won't get hurt.

09:47.600 --> 09:48.400
You're angry.

09:48.510 --> 09:49.510
What do you think?

09:49.600 --> 09:51.270
A whole group of Feiyu Guards
couldn't hurt you,

09:51.270 --> 09:52.840
yet you get injured with me.

09:54.030 --> 09:55.770
Should I call you stupid or...

09:55.960 --> 09:57.020
just plain stupid?

09:58.480 --> 09:59.010
Let's go.

10:05.840 --> 10:07.270
Compared to the Feiyu Guard,

10:07.270 --> 10:08.930
you're much more formidable.

10:12.900 --> 10:21.270
[Yong'an Palace]

10:15.910 --> 10:18.470
We haven't been allowed
into the bedchamber for days.

10:18.470 --> 10:20.150
She's been talking to herself...

10:20.150 --> 10:20.670
Could it be—

10:20.670 --> 10:21.390
Don't talk nonsense.

10:21.390 --> 10:23.150
Her Highness has become
much more cheerful lately.

10:23.150 --> 10:25.680
She's brought so much life
to Yong'an Palace.

10:25.720 --> 10:26.650
Let's pretend we didn't see that.

10:26.650 --> 10:27.570
Let's go, let's go.

10:27.250 --> 10:31.270
[Yong'an Palace]

10:42.630 --> 10:43.460
It's really fine.

10:43.460 --> 10:44.450
Don't talk.

10:55.380 --> 10:57.180
Don't do things like this again.

11:01.910 --> 11:02.430
Yes.

11:07.480 --> 11:08.340
Cute, isn't it?

11:23.990 --> 11:26.720
This is the most beautiful sunset
I've ever seen.

11:29.700 --> 11:30.900
Because it's high up?

11:41.790 --> 11:43.250
It's because you're here.

12:12.230 --> 12:12.850
Release.

12:16.550 --> 12:17.670
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

12:17.670 --> 12:18.440
It's just an arrow—

12:18.440 --> 12:20.170
why would you need to shield me?

12:20.270 --> 12:20.750
I...

12:23.390 --> 12:23.910
Hong Ye!

12:24.230 --> 12:25.960
You've trespassed into the palace

12:25.960 --> 12:27.760
and taken the princess hostage.

12:28.080 --> 12:28.600
Today,

12:29.190 --> 12:30.650
you will be executed!

12:30.750 --> 12:32.540
I invited the Demon King here.

12:32.670 --> 12:34.170
He did not trespass.

12:34.550 --> 12:35.870
If you dare shoot your arrows

12:35.870 --> 12:37.510
and harm me in any way,

12:37.530 --> 12:40.130
my father
will never forgive you Feiyu Guards.

12:43.240 --> 12:43.880
Princess,

12:44.320 --> 12:46.580
you were already punished with confinement

12:46.580 --> 12:48.780
for speaking in favor of demons before.

12:48.880 --> 12:50.720
Now you're colluding with demons again—

12:50.720 --> 12:52.010
are you planning treason?

12:52.010 --> 12:53.940
I will explain to my father myself.

12:54.200 --> 12:55.400
Let the Demon King go

12:55.670 --> 12:57.240
and you won't be implicated.

12:57.240 --> 12:57.970
You go first.

12:59.480 --> 13:01.960
Indeed,
I have taken Princess Ning'an hostage.

13:01.960 --> 13:03.440
If any of you dares to move,

13:05.030 --> 13:06.400
I will kill her.

13:06.790 --> 13:08.390
You couldn't stop me anyway.

13:08.440 --> 13:11.600
Now you want to needlessly risk
the princess's life as well?

13:11.600 --> 13:13.530
Can you bear that responsibility?

13:13.790 --> 13:14.270
Hong Ye!

13:14.630 --> 13:15.230
If you dare

13:15.320 --> 13:16.740
harm the princess today,

13:17.030 --> 13:17.870
Tiansheng Kingdom

13:17.870 --> 13:19.440
will mobilize its entire force

13:19.440 --> 13:20.840
to slaughter all demons!

13:24.510 --> 13:26.580
Instead of being this princess
in name only,

13:26.580 --> 13:28.600
how about you come with me
outside the palace

13:28.600 --> 13:29.660
to see the scenery.

13:31.440 --> 13:32.100
As you wish.

13:43.550 --> 13:44.610
Demon King Hong Ye,

13:44.960 --> 13:46.020
full of evil deeds,

13:46.240 --> 13:47.240
broke into Yong'an Palace,

13:47.240 --> 13:48.770
took the Princess hostage,

13:49.030 --> 13:50.370
and forced us

13:50.440 --> 13:51.570
to submit to demons.

13:59.200 --> 14:00.070
The Feiyu Guards

14:00.070 --> 14:01.290
are loyal and brave.

14:01.790 --> 14:03.600
None of us surrendered to the demons.

14:03.600 --> 14:04.890
But as a result, the Princess

14:04.890 --> 14:06.150
was taken by the Demon King.

14:05.280 --> 14:08.000
[Emperor Ning'an]

14:06.270 --> 14:06.890
We

14:07.130 --> 14:08.510
deserve death for our failure.

14:08.510 --> 14:09.650
We beg Your Majesty

14:09.750 --> 14:10.480
to punish us.

14:13.270 --> 14:14.440
What is your name?

14:19.550 --> 14:20.120
I am

14:21.240 --> 14:21.910
Wang Hong.

14:25.750 --> 14:27.480
What good strategy do you have?

14:31.900 --> 14:32.830
I believe

14:33.900 --> 14:35.960
the more arrogant the demons become,

14:36.630 --> 14:37.290
the more

14:37.390 --> 14:39.050
decisive our actions must be.

14:40.630 --> 14:41.610
I boldly request

14:41.720 --> 14:42.640
Your Majesty to allow

14:42.640 --> 14:44.640
the Feiyu Guard to expand its forces

14:44.750 --> 14:46.150
to form a righteous army,

14:46.390 --> 14:47.550
and attack the demon's lair

14:47.550 --> 14:48.880
to rescue the princess.

14:56.240 --> 14:58.000
You lost my princess

14:59.120 --> 15:01.120
but now you want more men and money?

15:09.320 --> 15:09.850
Granted.

15:20.490 --> 15:21.920
Wang Hong.

15:23.510 --> 15:24.680
From today on,

15:24.840 --> 15:28.000
you are appointed the Deputy Demon Slayer
of the Feiyu Guard.

15:28.000 --> 15:29.880
Command all Feiyu Guards across regions,

15:29.880 --> 15:31.100
locate the demon's lair,

15:31.100 --> 15:32.560
and eliminate the demons—

15:35.590 --> 15:36.990
to rescue the princess.

15:38.550 --> 15:38.960
I

15:40.030 --> 15:41.090
accept the decree.

15:41.090 --> 15:43.090
You have one month to complete this.

15:57.870 --> 15:58.740
Our

15:58.960 --> 16:00.560
princess who's confined in the cold palace

16:00.560 --> 16:02.420
has created quite an opportunity

16:02.750 --> 16:04.120
for the Feiyu Guard.

16:06.150 --> 16:07.380
Isn't that right,

16:07.510 --> 16:08.970
Deputy Demon Slayer Hong?

16:09.320 --> 16:10.580
It's all thanks to you,

16:10.890 --> 16:12.840
My Lord, and your brilliant strategy.

16:12.840 --> 16:13.870
I, Wang Hong,

16:13.870 --> 16:15.220
am completely devoted

16:15.790 --> 16:16.870
to you, My Lord.

16:22.270 --> 16:24.360
My position as Deputy Demon Slayer

16:25.600 --> 16:28.550
exists only to serve you better.

16:29.840 --> 16:30.670
For example,

16:31.360 --> 16:33.810
collecting compensation for soldiers

16:34.360 --> 16:36.020
who died fighting the demons.

16:44.930 --> 16:46.620
Where did you get
the plum blossoms from?

16:46.620 --> 16:47.680
Take me to see them.

17:05.660 --> 17:07.960
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

17:10.010 --> 17:12.130
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

17:14.050 --> 17:16.410
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

17:18.010 --> 17:21.099
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

17:21.160 --> 17:22.349
So beautiful!

17:22.619 --> 17:25.390
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

17:26.640 --> 17:27.240
Hong Ye,

17:26.980 --> 17:29.910
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue ♪

17:27.880 --> 17:29.740
can you pick a plum blossom for me?

17:31.300 --> 17:34.190
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

17:31.680 --> 17:32.070
Sure.

17:35.380 --> 17:38.000
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

17:41.650 --> 17:44.990
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

17:46.120 --> 17:49.300
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

17:50.550 --> 17:53.690
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

17:54.580 --> 17:57.200
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

18:20.550 --> 18:22.860
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

18:24.860 --> 18:27.260
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

18:29.040 --> 18:31.570
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

18:32.240 --> 18:33.750
Snowmen don't have horns.

18:33.160 --> 18:35.640
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

18:35.350 --> 18:36.350
It's a Snow Demon.

18:37.510 --> 18:40.280
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

18:37.960 --> 18:39.920
But this doesn't look good.

18:41.870 --> 18:44.800
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue ♪

18:43.590 --> 18:44.830
It's not about looking good.

18:44.830 --> 18:46.190
It should look intimidating.

18:46.190 --> 18:49.080
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

18:50.260 --> 18:52.880
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

18:50.710 --> 18:52.590
Stay away from my snowman.

18:52.920 --> 18:53.640
All right.

18:56.540 --> 18:59.980
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

19:01.010 --> 19:04.190
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

19:01.750 --> 19:02.440
Hong Ye!

19:04.150 --> 19:05.970
Why did you make it

19:05.660 --> 19:08.660
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

19:06.000 --> 19:07.480
so ugly?

19:08.000 --> 19:09.270
That's what a Snow Demon looks like.

19:09.270 --> 19:11.060
Turn it back quickly!

19:09.470 --> 19:12.940
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

19:11.260 --> 19:11.680
Don't!

19:13.350 --> 19:14.680
I don't want that!

19:14.680 --> 19:16.310
Turn it back now!

19:21.900 --> 19:25.230
Among all these years Princess Ning'an
has been in the palace,

19:25.230 --> 19:27.450
this must be her happiest day.

19:30.380 --> 19:32.510
Then you should tell Princess Ning'an

19:33.510 --> 19:35.170
not to forget this day.

19:35.580 --> 19:38.070
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

19:39.900 --> 19:42.310
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

19:44.080 --> 19:46.680
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

19:48.190 --> 19:50.750
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

19:52.540 --> 19:55.320
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

19:56.900 --> 19:59.830
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue ♪

19:59.460 --> 20:00.780
May these plum blossoms

20:00.780 --> 20:01.990
never wither.

20:01.220 --> 20:04.000
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

20:04.060 --> 20:06.340
May we always be as happy as we are today.

20:05.300 --> 20:07.920
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

20:09.790 --> 20:12.970
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

20:14.190 --> 20:17.440
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

20:18.580 --> 20:21.490
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

20:19.920 --> 20:21.550
I shall grant your wish.

20:22.660 --> 20:26.130
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

20:26.880 --> 20:29.260
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

20:30.500 --> 20:33.480
♪ I brew years of romance
and longing into wine ♪

20:34.640 --> 20:38.520
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

20:38.310 --> 20:39.890
The plum blossoms will never wither.

20:39.620 --> 20:42.540
♪ Eternal sorrows end, the broken cocoon
becomes an ark ♪

20:43.560 --> 20:46.410
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

20:47.510 --> 20:50.260
♪ I boil away my worries
with dew and strands of hair ♪

20:51.660 --> 20:55.750
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

20:56.970 --> 21:00.650
♪ Three lives of joy,
growing old with one heart ♪

21:15.590 --> 21:16.590
Candy figurines.

21:17.550 --> 21:18.550
Candy figurines!

21:19.510 --> 21:20.070
Fresh out of the pot.

21:20.070 --> 21:21.200
I want this one, Sir.

21:22.070 --> 21:22.640
Slowly.

21:27.400 --> 21:28.720
It's sweet. Try some.

21:31.920 --> 21:32.510
How is it?

21:33.670 --> 21:34.330
Delicious.

21:34.630 --> 21:35.890
I told you so, didn't I?

21:37.070 --> 21:39.000
Can you get these in the palace too?

21:40.190 --> 21:40.670
Well...

21:41.310 --> 21:42.710
Mocui told me about them.

21:43.880 --> 21:45.110
There are even more delicious things
over there.

21:45.110 --> 21:45.830
Let's go.

21:47.400 --> 21:49.120
My favorite dried plums.

21:51.120 --> 21:51.840
Try one.

21:53.350 --> 21:54.500
They stimulate appetite,
relieve depression,

21:54.500 --> 21:56.560
generate fluids, and quench thirst.

21:58.950 --> 21:59.950
You don't like it?

22:00.080 --> 22:01.410
Spit it out if you don't.

22:07.240 --> 22:08.300
It's sour at first,

22:08.650 --> 22:09.980
but then it turns sweet.

22:10.180 --> 22:12.440
No wonder
you've liked them since you were little.

22:12.440 --> 22:13.970
They really are delicious.

22:16.270 --> 22:17.480
Sir, I'll take a bag.

22:17.500 --> 22:18.070
Here.

22:29.910 --> 22:30.550
Hong Ye,

22:30.740 --> 22:33.600
what's the most delicious thing
you've ever eaten?

22:37.510 --> 22:38.770
It's not humans, is it?

22:39.480 --> 22:40.190
Tell me,

22:40.350 --> 22:41.200
over thousands of years,

22:41.200 --> 22:42.640
how many people have you eaten?

22:42.640 --> 22:44.210
Confess now!

22:44.830 --> 22:45.720
Okay.

22:45.880 --> 22:46.650
I confess.

22:49.350 --> 22:51.350
You've really eaten humans before?

22:53.070 --> 22:53.880
Do you know,

22:54.270 --> 22:55.960
the demons who died at human hands

22:55.960 --> 22:58.070
far outnumber the humans
who died at the hands

22:58.070 --> 22:58.880
of demons?

23:01.370 --> 23:02.480
You're only talking about

23:02.480 --> 23:05.990
the royal family obsessed
with immortality and demon hunters.

23:05.990 --> 23:08.350
Look at these ordinary people
on the street.

23:08.350 --> 23:11.160
Many of them may have never seen
a demon in their entire lives.

23:11.160 --> 23:13.630
They just want to live their own lives.

23:14.040 --> 23:16.170
Many demons are the same, aren't they?

23:16.310 --> 23:18.570
If everyone could just live peacefully,

23:18.580 --> 23:21.040
why must there be
such hostility between us?

23:21.160 --> 23:21.840
Hong Ye,

23:22.350 --> 23:24.080
will you promise me something?

23:26.070 --> 23:26.600
Go ahead.

23:28.590 --> 23:29.650
Demons eat people—

23:30.420 --> 23:31.370
yet you do not.

23:39.680 --> 23:41.140
In the eyes of many humans,

23:42.310 --> 23:43.460
all demons

23:44.270 --> 23:45.550
are born to eat people.

23:47.200 --> 23:48.860
So whether I eat humans or not,

23:49.240 --> 23:50.570
it makes no difference.

23:52.410 --> 23:54.740
Don't you want to break these prejudices?

23:54.930 --> 23:56.300
Of course I do.

23:57.550 --> 24:00.080
Resolving the conflict
between our two races

24:00.100 --> 24:01.500
is easier said than done.

24:02.310 --> 24:04.560
We can start with small steps.

24:04.620 --> 24:06.000
-Maybe in a hundred years...
-Demon!

24:06.000 --> 24:06.660
There's a demon!

24:06.660 --> 24:07.830
A demon is eating people!

24:07.830 --> 24:08.510
Demon!

24:09.310 --> 24:10.240
There's a demon!

24:14.440 --> 24:16.910
[Heal the World]

24:14.880 --> 24:15.720
Madam.

24:16.160 --> 24:18.040
Madam, wake up.

24:18.160 --> 24:20.000
Please wake up, Madam.

24:20.570 --> 24:22.430
I've spent half my life saving people,

24:22.430 --> 24:24.190
yet I couldn't save you.

24:28.790 --> 24:30.400
Liu, Liu...

24:30.660 --> 24:33.510
-Hanxiang and I treated you so well.
-I want to see.

24:34.150 --> 24:36.050
Why did you do this?

24:36.170 --> 24:37.960
If you had a problem,
you should have come to me!

24:37.960 --> 24:38.880
Liu!

24:39.680 --> 24:41.480
Let me go!

24:41.790 --> 24:42.720
Let me go!

24:46.590 --> 24:47.650
Where is the demon?

24:48.350 --> 24:49.250
That's him.

24:55.450 --> 24:56.740
He's clearly human.

24:57.830 --> 24:58.710
Liu

24:58.740 --> 25:00.200
is a servant at the clinic.

25:00.270 --> 25:01.800
He's been here for over a decade.

25:01.800 --> 25:03.530
He's always been an honest man.

25:03.680 --> 25:05.560
Just now, he suddenly went mad,

25:05.670 --> 25:07.480
grabbed a kitchen knife,
and started slashing people.

25:07.480 --> 25:09.540
He killed the mistress of the clinic.

25:09.800 --> 25:11.430
If the officers hadn't arrived,

25:11.430 --> 25:13.630
who knows how many more would have died.

25:14.100 --> 25:15.140
Liu,

25:15.160 --> 25:17.190
he usually avoids
even seeing chickens being killed.

25:17.190 --> 25:18.520
This sudden madness...

25:18.910 --> 25:20.710
Could he be possessed by a demon?

25:22.690 --> 25:24.210
Demons are eating people!

25:24.350 --> 25:25.770
Demons are eating people!

25:25.770 --> 25:26.490
Move aside!

25:27.270 --> 25:28.130
Eating people?

25:28.360 --> 25:30.090
Being a demon is such busy work.

25:32.510 --> 25:33.970
Demons are eating people!

25:34.000 --> 25:34.960
Demons are eating people!

25:34.960 --> 25:35.530
Move!

25:35.590 --> 25:36.070
Help!

25:36.070 --> 25:36.510
Stop!

25:36.510 --> 25:37.000
Help me!

25:38.000 --> 25:38.740
Where is the demon?

25:38.740 --> 25:39.640
The demon is behind!

25:39.640 --> 25:40.300
Back there!

25:42.720 --> 25:43.200
My Lord.

25:44.590 --> 25:46.610
It's my son's wedding night today.

25:46.630 --> 25:48.440
W-We were drinking until midnight

25:48.440 --> 25:49.890
and had just sent him
to the bridal chamber.

25:49.890 --> 25:52.100
[Jin Jr.'s Father]

25:49.960 --> 25:52.040
Then we heard a scream from inside.

25:52.200 --> 25:53.760
When we went to check,

25:53.920 --> 25:55.500
only my son remained in the room.

25:54.260 --> 25:56.820
[Jin Jr.] [Jin Jr.'s Mother]

25:55.590 --> 25:57.030
The bride was gone.

25:57.200 --> 25:58.400
Did you see any demon?

25:59.790 --> 26:00.350
No.

26:02.310 --> 26:04.000
Who took the bride?

26:04.440 --> 26:05.210
A demon!

26:07.510 --> 26:09.440
Think carefully before you speak.

26:09.510 --> 26:11.770
So the officers can help find your bride.

26:15.550 --> 26:17.210
Take us to the bridal chamber.

26:18.510 --> 26:19.110
Let's go.

26:19.270 --> 26:20.430
Come on, move.

26:20.610 --> 26:22.590
Let's go, hurry up.

26:26.830 --> 26:28.030
Want to go take a look?

26:28.240 --> 26:29.590
It's probably another robbery and murder

26:29.590 --> 26:31.200
with demons taking the blame.

26:31.200 --> 26:33.000
I'm afraid it's not that simple.

26:33.480 --> 26:34.740
I'd like to take a look.

26:38.200 --> 26:39.370
Mother is here.

26:41.140 --> 26:42.240
It hurts?

26:42.400 --> 26:43.440
Look at this.

26:42.640 --> 26:43.390
[Happiness]

26:46.230 --> 26:47.890
Look at the blood on the floor.

26:48.400 --> 26:49.740
And the window.

26:50.420 --> 26:50.880
If...

26:51.920 --> 26:53.240
If it wasn't a demon,

26:54.320 --> 26:56.190
who could have taken

26:56.530 --> 26:57.730
a living person away?

26:57.920 --> 26:59.020
Indeed.

26:59.110 --> 27:00.030
Tigers and leopards

27:00.030 --> 27:01.880
can't enter the city.

27:02.910 --> 27:04.310
Until we find a body,

27:04.640 --> 27:06.830
we can only call it a missing person case.

27:06.830 --> 27:08.240
We need to investigate thoroughly

27:08.240 --> 27:09.970
before reaching a conclusion.

27:10.480 --> 27:10.890
But...

27:11.000 --> 27:11.500
Well...

27:11.550 --> 27:13.190
With this much blood loss,

27:13.590 --> 27:15.550
the person couldn't have survived.

27:15.550 --> 27:17.210
Regardless of what happened,

27:17.650 --> 27:20.200
we must investigate
before making any conclusions.

27:20.200 --> 27:21.070
Yes, yes.

27:22.400 --> 27:24.590
This Jin family's son has such bad luck.

27:24.590 --> 27:26.450
He married someone two years ago,

27:26.590 --> 27:27.550
and just days after the wedding,

27:27.550 --> 27:28.880
the bride disappeared.

27:28.920 --> 27:29.640
Could it be

27:29.640 --> 27:30.750
she was also eaten by a demon?

27:30.750 --> 27:31.530
Exactly!

27:31.590 --> 27:33.110
Could demons really have eaten her?

27:33.110 --> 27:34.180
No way.

27:34.400 --> 27:35.660
Let's go. Case solved.

27:38.250 --> 27:40.090
Let's go take a look.

27:42.270 --> 27:44.070
The old couple didn't see how

27:44.070 --> 27:45.400
the bride disappeared.

27:45.480 --> 27:46.440
They didn't search for her

27:46.440 --> 27:48.500
but assumed she was dead.

27:48.720 --> 27:49.960
And the groom was

27:49.960 --> 27:52.480
shouting all over town
about demons eating people.

27:52.480 --> 27:54.280
It's as if he wanted everyone to know.

27:54.280 --> 27:55.400
When the officials came to question them,

27:55.400 --> 27:56.680
they hemmed and hawed,

27:56.680 --> 27:57.640
stuttered,

27:57.640 --> 27:58.640
and gave irrelevant answers.

27:58.640 --> 28:01.500
They clearly
had no intention of finding the bride.

28:02.740 --> 28:03.340
And another thing—

28:03.310 --> 28:04.140
[Happiness]

28:03.410 --> 28:05.640
the bridal chamber was a wreck,

28:06.270 --> 28:09.330
but the furnishings
and utensils were quite valuable.

28:09.620 --> 28:11.790
If the bride was truly eaten by a demon,

28:11.880 --> 28:15.200
why were her jewelry and accessories
still neatly placed on the table?

28:15.200 --> 28:17.460
There's blood on the walls and floor,

28:17.550 --> 28:19.730
yet why is that brocade quilt

28:19.830 --> 28:20.970
completely clean?

28:23.310 --> 28:24.790
Those valuable items

28:24.790 --> 28:26.720
were all part of the bride's dowry.

28:27.160 --> 28:28.750
Other than what's shown,

28:28.880 --> 28:31.110
they must have been given
other things too.

28:31.110 --> 28:32.920
Pawning this dowry into silver

28:32.920 --> 28:34.640
would be enough
for the family to change their identities

28:34.640 --> 28:36.560
and start a new life elsewhere.

28:36.750 --> 28:37.880
You've heard it too.

28:38.000 --> 28:40.200
The groom was married before years ago,

28:40.200 --> 28:42.060
and that bride also disappeared.

28:42.230 --> 28:44.230
He's just an experienced criminal.

28:44.550 --> 28:46.680
You claim you've never left the palace,

28:46.680 --> 28:47.680
yet how do you know so much about

28:47.680 --> 28:49.750
these worldly, sordid schemes?

28:50.440 --> 28:51.640
You seem more like someone who has lived

28:51.640 --> 28:53.640
among common people for a long time.

28:54.680 --> 28:55.310
I...

28:56.270 --> 28:57.470
I've read many books.

28:57.920 --> 29:00.920
Books describe human nature
and the ways of the world.

29:01.400 --> 29:02.590
The most important thing for us now

29:02.590 --> 29:04.390
is to find out where the bride is.

29:04.400 --> 29:05.240
Either we see her alive,

29:05.240 --> 29:06.700
or we need to find her body.

29:06.750 --> 29:08.350
What you said might be right,

29:08.400 --> 29:09.860
but you missed something.

29:10.550 --> 29:13.000
There really were demons
in the bridal chamber.

29:13.000 --> 29:14.460
And there's more than one.

29:16.230 --> 29:17.360
Why didn't I see it?

29:18.030 --> 29:18.960
Where were they?

29:18.960 --> 29:19.790
Where?

29:20.720 --> 29:23.250
Sometimes what your eyes see
isn't the truth.

29:23.310 --> 29:25.110
Maybe there's more to the truth.

29:25.920 --> 29:26.850
Let's make a bet.

29:27.510 --> 29:29.200
I'll go find the murderer
of the hospital murder.

29:29.200 --> 29:31.000
You go find the bride.

29:31.000 --> 29:32.310
Let's see who's faster.

29:32.310 --> 29:33.170
What's the bet?

29:35.110 --> 29:37.070
Winner gets to request the loser
to do something,

29:37.070 --> 29:38.510
and the loser can't refuse.

29:38.510 --> 29:39.110
Okay.

29:39.750 --> 29:40.480
Pinky swear.

29:49.550 --> 29:50.680
The Hong Ye from one hundred years ago

29:50.680 --> 29:52.480
was so competitive?

29:54.590 --> 29:55.390
Interesting.

30:21.550 --> 30:22.270
Dr. Zhang.

30:22.550 --> 30:24.190
You have family matters to attend to.

30:24.190 --> 30:26.110
Why don't you close the clinic for today?

30:26.110 --> 30:27.590
These are just minor ailments.

30:27.590 --> 30:29.240
If my wife's spirit is watching,

30:29.240 --> 30:30.300
she would want

30:30.640 --> 30:32.500
me to take good care of my patients

30:32.590 --> 30:33.790
rather than dwelling

30:34.720 --> 30:35.640
in sorrow.

30:40.440 --> 30:41.970
Here's your prescription.

30:42.080 --> 30:42.900
Dr. Zhang.

30:43.400 --> 30:45.590
You and your wife were truly good people.

30:45.590 --> 30:46.850
May your wife's spirit

30:47.330 --> 30:48.410
watch over you.

30:48.590 --> 30:50.440
Thank you. Take care.

30:55.110 --> 30:55.920
Next patient.

31:00.310 --> 31:01.270
Young sir,

31:01.480 --> 31:03.210
what seems to be troubling you?

31:06.070 --> 31:07.070
Chest tightness?

31:08.750 --> 31:09.740
You mean

31:10.030 --> 31:10.920
chest pain?

31:13.790 --> 31:14.400
Sir,

31:15.000 --> 31:16.790
what exactly is bothering you?

31:20.030 --> 31:20.880
It's gone.

31:22.920 --> 31:24.060
What's gone?

31:25.000 --> 31:25.960
Conscience.

31:28.270 --> 31:29.680
The conscience is gone.

31:34.450 --> 31:35.440
Young sir,

31:36.310 --> 31:38.050
stop pulling my leg.

31:38.270 --> 31:40.130
There are many patients waiting.

31:42.200 --> 31:44.130
How is your father-in-law lately?

31:51.240 --> 31:52.180
Sir,

31:52.640 --> 31:54.450
are you acquainted with him?

31:55.000 --> 31:56.000
Not at all.

31:59.110 --> 32:00.110
If you're not ill,

32:00.440 --> 32:01.970
please stop joking with me.

32:03.070 --> 32:04.790
To send your benefactor's daughter

32:04.790 --> 32:05.990
to her death.

32:06.590 --> 32:08.670
Where has your conscience gone?

32:09.590 --> 32:10.770
He killed her?

32:10.830 --> 32:12.110
What?

32:12.840 --> 32:13.440
Is that true?

32:13.440 --> 32:14.550
He said he killed her.

32:14.550 --> 32:16.080
What are you talking about?

32:16.790 --> 32:18.250
I don't understand at all.

32:19.350 --> 32:21.880
From a second-rate street doctor

32:21.880 --> 32:24.140
to owning the largest clinic in town now—

32:24.380 --> 32:26.750
it's all thanks to your wealthy merchant
father-in-law's support.

32:26.750 --> 32:27.580
Now

32:27.880 --> 32:29.480
you had an affair with another woman

32:29.480 --> 32:30.830
and your wife found out.

32:31.000 --> 32:33.330
You were afraid she would tell her father.

32:33.590 --> 32:35.530
So you used your servant, Liu.

32:35.750 --> 32:37.070
You brewed him a tonic

32:37.070 --> 32:38.920
claiming it was
for strengthening his body,

32:38.920 --> 32:40.680
but it actually worsened his insomnia,

32:40.680 --> 32:41.680
caused him excitement

32:41.680 --> 32:43.140
and even hallucinations.

32:43.960 --> 32:44.790
You knew very well

32:44.790 --> 32:46.440
that a person who doesn't sleep for days

32:46.440 --> 32:48.440
is capable of doing anything.

32:48.510 --> 32:50.880
So after a big fight with your wife,

32:50.880 --> 32:53.070
you locked her up

32:53.070 --> 32:54.870
with the mentally unstable Liu.

32:55.550 --> 32:56.350
This

32:57.680 --> 32:59.810
is the prescription you wrote for Liu.

33:05.160 --> 33:06.070
Nonsense!

33:06.240 --> 33:07.640
You're making things up.

33:08.550 --> 33:10.830
Still trying to deny it?

33:10.850 --> 33:13.650
Do I need to lay out
all the evidence piece by piece?

33:16.350 --> 33:16.960
Go ahead.

33:17.750 --> 33:19.320
I have nothing to hide.

33:19.960 --> 33:21.160
You have a hunched back,

33:21.160 --> 33:23.270
chronic ailments,

33:23.270 --> 33:24.720
and you cough when agitated—

33:24.720 --> 33:27.030
all problems you developed
when you were young.

33:27.030 --> 33:28.830
This shows you came from poverty,

33:28.830 --> 33:30.920
too poor to treat even minor illnesses.

33:30.920 --> 33:32.150
And that handkerchief of yours—

33:32.150 --> 33:33.480
it's clearly a woman's,

33:33.880 --> 33:35.680
with traces of rouge on it.

33:36.590 --> 33:37.550
But it's new.

33:38.160 --> 33:40.590
This indicates that the woman
you're having an affair with

33:40.590 --> 33:42.110
has been with you

33:42.110 --> 33:43.440
for about three months.

33:43.880 --> 33:44.830
Now you no longer have

33:44.830 --> 33:47.030
the initial nervousness and concerns.

33:48.440 --> 33:50.510
She can now start leaving

33:50.510 --> 33:51.910
personal items with you.

33:53.720 --> 33:54.750
When your father-in-law was mentioned,

33:54.750 --> 33:55.590
you clenched your fists,

33:55.590 --> 33:56.720
showing your anger.

33:57.350 --> 33:59.950
Your raised eyebrows
show vigilance and fear.

34:00.480 --> 34:02.070
But you don't feel the slightest pain

34:02.070 --> 34:03.680
for your wife's passing.

34:06.680 --> 34:08.239
That bedding is very soft,

34:08.800 --> 34:10.610
clearly used daily,

34:10.710 --> 34:13.400
suggesting you've been separated
from your wife for a long time.

34:13.400 --> 34:14.280
The smash marks

34:14.280 --> 34:15.710
on this table and chair

34:15.710 --> 34:16.639
are still fresh.

34:18.070 --> 34:18.710
Why?

34:43.760 --> 34:44.760
It's still there,

34:45.760 --> 34:47.489
but it has turned black.

34:49.000 --> 34:50.210
You did the evil,

34:50.320 --> 34:52.050
yet you blame the demons for it.

34:52.110 --> 34:52.880
Today,

34:52.920 --> 34:54.320
I will bring justice for your wife,

34:54.320 --> 34:56.360
Liu, and the demons.

35:03.800 --> 35:04.630
Heartless!

35:05.960 --> 35:07.050
Utterly immoral!

35:07.280 --> 35:09.890
If his wife had agreed to him
taking a concubine,

35:09.890 --> 35:11.750
would she not have died unjustly?

35:13.280 --> 35:14.540
That wouldn't happen.

35:15.150 --> 35:16.630
The woman he was having an affair with

35:16.630 --> 35:18.690
was his father-in-law's concubine.

35:19.150 --> 35:20.810
You deserve worse than death!

35:22.840 --> 35:24.280
I have one last question.

35:24.670 --> 35:26.440
The prescription he wrote for Liu—

35:26.440 --> 35:27.550
how did you find it?

35:41.000 --> 35:42.810
He was just being guilty.

35:42.830 --> 35:44.490
With one bluff, he confessed.

35:46.970 --> 35:49.100
Have you really never left the palace?

35:49.760 --> 35:50.480
Yes.

35:51.940 --> 35:53.440
You're very experienced

35:53.460 --> 35:55.480
and well-versed in social dynamics.

35:55.480 --> 35:57.280
You're good at dealing with villains—

35:57.280 --> 35:58.840
you feel like a swindler.

36:01.760 --> 36:02.610
Talent—

36:02.840 --> 36:04.410
this is called talent.

36:05.000 --> 36:05.670
You lost.

36:05.670 --> 36:07.200
You must do one thing for me.

36:07.230 --> 36:08.430
How do you know I lost?

36:09.230 --> 36:10.480
You found the bride?

36:10.480 --> 36:11.680
Of course I found her.

36:11.880 --> 36:13.410
Why else would I come to you?

36:13.480 --> 36:14.150
Where is she?

36:14.150 --> 36:15.150
Take me to her now.

36:34.190 --> 36:34.710
Miss.

36:45.070 --> 36:47.030
Is this the missing bride?

36:47.190 --> 36:48.590
Are you trying to fool me?

36:48.670 --> 36:49.480
Young master,

36:49.960 --> 36:51.360
my childhood name is Cui.

36:51.760 --> 36:54.030
Since childhood, I've wanted to leave home
to pursue immortal cultivation.

36:54.030 --> 36:55.630
I didn't want to deal
with worldly affairs,

36:55.630 --> 36:58.030
and especially didn't want to be bound
by marriage.

36:58.030 --> 36:59.670
But my family wouldn't allow it.

36:59.670 --> 37:01.000
That's why I found Jin's family

37:01.000 --> 37:02.460
and arranged this scheme.

37:02.920 --> 37:04.110
They kept the dowry,

37:04.110 --> 37:05.280
and I gained my freedom.

37:05.280 --> 37:06.680
We both got what we wanted

37:07.030 --> 37:08.430
without hurting anyone.

37:09.070 --> 37:11.150
Please keep my secret

37:11.400 --> 37:12.400
and spare my life.

37:18.840 --> 37:19.440
Miss,

37:19.760 --> 37:21.960
your parents raised you your entire life.

37:21.960 --> 37:23.030
To them,

37:23.030 --> 37:24.400
they don't know if you're still alive.

37:24.400 --> 37:25.430
They will spend

37:25.510 --> 37:27.630
the rest of their lives
in pain and regret.

37:27.630 --> 37:28.550
Isn't this

37:28.550 --> 37:31.810
more heartbreaking
than leaving without saying goodbye?

37:32.110 --> 37:34.030
My parents only care about their sons,

37:34.030 --> 37:35.000
not me.

37:35.590 --> 37:38.450
If my parents treated me
like how Jin treats his son,

37:39.030 --> 37:42.090
perhaps I wouldn't think
about leaving home every day.

37:54.190 --> 37:55.000
I won't go!

37:55.000 --> 37:56.360
I don't want to go anywhere!

37:56.360 --> 37:57.160
Son.

37:57.360 --> 37:59.070
The officials finally left.

37:59.070 --> 38:00.440
We need to leave quickly.

38:00.440 --> 38:01.400
I won't go!

38:01.400 --> 38:02.030
There are demons everywhere outside!

38:02.030 --> 38:03.030
I'm not going anywhere! I refuse!

38:03.030 --> 38:04.150
If we don't leave now, it'll be too late.

38:04.150 --> 38:04.550
Hurry!

38:05.190 --> 38:06.550
You have no choice. Let's go!

38:06.550 --> 38:07.590
Help! Help!

38:08.440 --> 38:09.710
Don't attract attention.

38:09.710 --> 38:11.710
You've got the dowry and valuables.

38:13.400 --> 38:14.800
Why haven't you left yet?

38:17.110 --> 38:18.060
There are demons everywhere outside.

38:18.060 --> 38:19.390
I'm not going anywhere.

38:26.280 --> 38:28.080
You say you're afraid of demons,

38:28.880 --> 38:29.810
but what are you?

38:30.190 --> 38:31.320
What else could I be?

38:31.630 --> 38:32.830
I'm human, of course.

38:33.360 --> 38:33.960
Is that so?

38:46.630 --> 38:47.070
Demon!

38:47.440 --> 38:47.840
Demon!

38:49.480 --> 38:50.210
Demonic art!

38:50.610 --> 38:50.920
You...

38:50.920 --> 38:51.800
You're deceiving me!

38:51.800 --> 38:53.000
You're deceiving me!

38:53.230 --> 38:54.030
Demonic arts!

38:54.150 --> 38:54.920
Demonic arts!

38:54.920 --> 38:55.720
Demonic arts!

39:07.880 --> 39:09.340
Stop deceiving yourself.

39:22.880 --> 39:24.210
Don't be afraid, my son.

39:27.360 --> 39:29.330
All of you are chipmunks?

39:33.000 --> 39:33.760
Are you two

39:34.230 --> 39:36.030
demon-hunting immortals?

39:37.510 --> 39:40.110
Our family has lived among humans

39:40.280 --> 39:41.960
without harming anyone.

39:43.840 --> 39:46.360
Please be merciful

39:47.110 --> 39:48.650
and spare our lives.

39:49.150 --> 39:51.280
I am Hong Ye, the Monarch of All Demons.

39:51.550 --> 39:52.320
My duty

39:53.070 --> 39:54.840
is to protect all demons.
